        "en": "For over a year and a half, I took part in the development of enterprise web applications using Rebrit's proprietary frameworks. I worked on both building new systems from scratch and maintaining applications in production, resolving incidents, integrating with APIs, implementing responsive interfaces and evolving the company's internal framework. Most of the work involved understanding existing architectures, analysing code written by other team members and developing new features while keeping the system compatible."
